    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7601" root="حرد" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرُودٌ</span></b>  (S, A, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَارِدٌ</span></b>  (A, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُحَارَدَةٌ</span></b> 
(K, TA, but omitted in some copies of the K) A
she-camel <i>yielding little milk:</i> (S, A, K:) or
<i>ceasing to yield milk,</i> or <i>to have milk in her
udder.</i> (K.)

